[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0010","text":"这边看起来也有不少贝壳呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0020","text":"看赶海的人不多，\n这里说不定是个小众好去处呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0030","text":"摩美美怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0040","text":"……没什么\n就是在想，有没有什么好东西掉在这里呢—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0050","text":"好东西是指什么样的～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0060","text":"嗯——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0070","text":"比如值钱的东西之类的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0080","text":"呵呵，原来如此\n梦想还是大一点好嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0090","text":"不过看起来，好像只有垃圾的样子—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0100","text":"捡垃圾也……是很重要的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
